 "lines": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "text": "In 1947, a moth made a computer fail.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 3.222
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "text": "I'm a moth. We need to talk about it.",
   "start": 3.672,
   "end": 5.507
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "text": "This is the Harvard Mark II.",
   "start": 5.957,
   "end": 7.514
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "text": "A room full of relays: little metal switches that click open and shut to do math.",
   "start": 7.964,
   "end": 12.529
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "text": "On September 9th, it started giving wrong answers.",
   "start": 12.979,
   "end": 15.817
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "text": "So the team searched it, relay by relay…",
   "start": 15.997,
   "end": 18.237
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "text": "and found her. A moth, stuck between the contacts.",
   "start": 18.687,
   "end": 21.311
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "text": "And they did the most engineer thing possible:",
   "start": 21.761,
   "end": 24.15
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "text": "they taped her into the logbook, and wrote:",
   "start": 24.33,
   "end": 26.293
  },
  {
   "scene": 7,
   "text": "\"First actual case of bug being found.\"",
   "start": 26.473,
   "end": 28.713
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "text": "Here's the part nobody tells you.",
   "start": 29.163,
   "end": 30.912
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "text": "They didn't invent the word. Engineers already called glitches \"bugs\".",
   "start": 31.092,
   "end": 34.975
  },
  {
   "scene": 8,
   "text": "Edison wrote it in 1878.",
   "start": 35.155,
   "end": 37.267
  },
  {
   "scene": 9,
   "text": "That's the joke: an actual bug.",
   "start": 37.717,
   "end": 39.402
  },
  {
   "scene": 10,
   "text": "Bright light. Let's check if it's a lamp or a fire.",
   "start": 39.852,
   "end": 42.348
  },
  {
   "scene": 10,
   "text": "No, Grace Hopper didn't pull it out.",
   "start": 42.528,
   "end": 44.384
  },
  {
   "scene": 10,
   "text": "She was on the team, and she helped make the story famous.",
   "start": 44.564,
   "end": 47.38
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "text": "So the most famous bug in history wasn't the first bug.",
   "start": 47.83,
   "end": 50.923
  },
  {
   "scene": 11,
   "text": "Just the first one with wings.",
   "start": 51.103,
   "end": 52.575
  },
  {
   "scene": 12,
   "text": "That page is kept at the Smithsonian today. Moth included.",
   "start": 53.025,
   "end": 56.588
  },
  {
   "scene": 13,
   "text": "Every time you debug something… you're talking about my family.",
   "start": 57.038,
   "end": 60.366
  },
  {
   "scene": 14,
   "text": "Stay curious. Not too close to the light.",
   "start": 60.816,
   "end": 63.077
  }
 ],
